Interop peers (run, not included)
--------------------------------

interop/libmbus.Dockerfile builds libmbus 0.10.3 (BSD-3-Clause,
Copyright (c) 2010-2012 Raditex Control AB; https://github.com/rscada/
libmbus) from its tag on debian:bookworm-20240926-slim, with its TCP
answer timeout lowered from 4 s to 1 s, to run its commands against the
simulated bus in the interop tests. Nothing of libmbus is kept in this
repository; rSCADA and Raditex Control are credited as libmbus asks.
wmbusmeters (GPL-3.0-or-later) is run from its published image in the
same way.

Test values
-----------

Every meter ID, manufacturer code, key, access number and reading in
this module is a test value, not that of a real meter. Do not use the
keys on real devices.

